  "description": "The only thing more unbelievable than the superior handling and stability of the Flightline 29 Two is the price tag. Built on the FL3Gi frame platform, the Flightline 29 Two is ready to deliver maximum value and smiles. The disc brake equipped, 24 speed Flightline 29 Two brings big wheel fun to help you conquer rock gardens that you never thought you could ride. Fully redesigned to be lighter weight with high-end features found on bikes costing more than twice as much, the Flightline Two is second to none.\nSR Suntour XCT 29, 100mm travel w/ preload adjust\nShimano Altus front and rear derailleurs\nShimano HG 31, 8-speed, 11-32 cassette\nPivit alloy 30mm riser bar 31.8mm / Pivit forged stem\nShimano EF-51 8-speed shifters\nPivit alloy disc cassette hubs 32h\nTektro Novela disc brakeset",
